+// build 117: RIPSHOT on MMCE. The roll is opened here and stays open into the game: CDVDMAN reads and writes it by the
+// descriptor the card gave it (fileXioIoctl2 0x80, as the ISO's and the VMCs'). A launch that came back closes the last one
+static int rsMmceFd = -1;
